<title>USA: U.S. ammonia prices steady, some DAP values weaken.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia prices steady, some DAP values weaken.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate (DAP) were down slightly and ammonia was unchanged from Monday, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Ammonia prices were supported by brisk eastern Midwest sales, while DAP values came under pressure from delayed fieldwork caused by flooding and excessive moisture in some states, dealers said.</p>
<p>				Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		174-176	     dn 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  188-189	     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170		   unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
